4. `cairo/settlement/src/settlement::receive_cross_chain_callback`:  
   [link](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-chakra/blob/d0d45ae1d26ca1b87034e67180fac07ce9642fd9/cairo/settlement/src/settlement.cairo#L415)

In the `check_chakra_signatures` function, which is used to validate these signatures in both handler and settlement contracts:

- [link](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-chakra/blob/d0d45ae1d26ca1b87034e67180fac07ce9642fd9/cairo/handler/src/settlement.cairo#L173)
